      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Pay attention to the <color=red>timer</color>. When it starts going down,
    it means the beast hungers. Click and hold the <color=red>button</color>. And
    be on top of it; if that timer reaches zero, it will bring about the end of days.

    And
    you will be fired.'
